    "https://employmenthero.com/jobs/position/excelsia-university-college-field-education-academic-lead-twj65/": {
      "title": "Field Education Academic Lead Job",
      "description": "Field Education Academic Lead Job at Excelsia University College Skip to content You have been redirected to your preferred market of Australia . Clear preference × You're viewing our Australia site. Select your region to visit the most relevant site for you. Select region New Zealand United Kingdom Singapore Malaysia Canada (Français) Canada (English) × Work Jobs Find the role Land the role Ask Hero AI Learn Login Work HR & Recruitment Payroll Employee Jobs Jobseeker AU Australia New Zealand United Kingdom Canada Singapore Malaysia Get started Jobseeker Employee Employer Work Jobs Find the role Land the role Learn Login Australia Back Learn Trending News Article How 500 Lunches With Strangers Led To A Winning Business Mindset 6 min read Video How to Explain a Resume Gap in an Interview (Without Apologising) | The Jobseeker Series Video Recruiters Judge Your Profile in 8 Seconds: Here’s How to Win | The Jobseeker Series Video Is Your AI Resume Making You Invisible to Recruiters? | The Jobseeker Series Resource Types Webinars & Events Salary Calculator Blogs & Guides Interview Prep Support Centre Career Advice All Resources Topics AI Best Practice Workplace Effectiveness Wellbeing at Work Learning & Development Remote Working Employment Index Interview Preparation Benchmark Your Salary Job Hunting Tips Making Your Salary Go Further Writing a Great CV Networking Career Planning Future of Work Mentorship All Topics Get Started Trending News Article How 500 Lunches With Strangers Led To A Winning Business Mindset 6 min read Video How to Explain a Resume Gap in an Interview (Without Apologising) | The Jobseeker Series Video Recruiters Judge Your Profile in 8 Seconds: Here’s How to Win | The Jobseeker Series Resource Types Webinars & Events Salary Calculator Blogs & Guides Interview Prep Support Centre Career Advice All Resources Topics AI Best Practice Workplace Effectiveness Wellbeing at Work Learning & Development Remote Working Employment Index Interview Preparation Benchmark Your Salary Job Hunting Tips Making Your Salary Go Further Writing a Great CV Networking Career Planning Future of Work Mentorship All Topics Australia New Zealand United Kingdom Canada Singapore Malaysia Work HR & Recruitment Payroll Employee Jobs Jobseeker Jobseeker Employee Employer Share Copy link Twitter LinkedIn Facebook Report this job Refer a friend Apply now Jobs Education & Training Field Education Academic Lead Field Education Academic Lead at Excelsia University College Pennant Hills, New South Wales 2120 , Australia • Full-time AI Job Summary Hold a Masters and/or PhD in a relevant Social Work discipline. Be a member of, or eligible for membership of the AASW. Have at least 5 years’ experience as a qualified Social Worker. Sign up or log in to analyse my fit Role Type On-site • Permanent • Full-time • Qualified Description Permanent, full-time position with free onsite parking A fantastic opportunity for a Level B/C academic to lead a thriving Social Work field education program Be an integral part of Excelsia’s life-transforming global Christian learning community. About the Role Primary responsibilities include: To provide students with quality and value-added education through leadership and oversight of the social work field education program to facilitate student learning within a caring Christian environment. To oversee the development and delivery of placement preparation and training for students and staff through appropriate lectures, workshops, and theory to practice integration tutorials that align with ASWEAS standards. To prepare and develop School curricula relevant to field education in consultation with the Head of School. To contribute to the development of School of Social Work practicum curricula and accompanying practicum documentation, in consultation with the Head of School. To manage the Field Education Coordinators. To oversee the management and recruitment of appropriately qualified Social Work casual staff for Field Educator and Field Education Liaison Officer roles for students on placement. To ensure the activities of the School are operated effectively and efficiently and provide a quality service to the students and staff. Selection Criteria Qualifications and Professional Standing: Committed Christian involved in a local congregation. Hold a Masters and/or PhD qualification in relevant Social Work discipline. Member or eligible to be member of the AASW Experience in field education either as a Field Educator (Supervisor) and/or Field Education Liaison Officer. Evidence of teaching experience in a higher education setting. Minimum of 5 years’ experience as a qualified Social Worker. A proven record of professional activities and ideally record of research and academic publications. An understanding of current and emerging trends in education as a whole and discipline Social Work in particular. Demonstrated high level of skills in written and oral communication and information literacy and ability to prioritise and meet deadlines. Demonstrated awareness of and sensitivity to diversity and ability to work with students, staff, and administrators, including pastoral skills in mentoring staff and supporting students. Evidence of commitment to personal professional development, including research and/or professional practice and maintenance of relevant professional skills in the field of expertise. Full Australian Working Rights. About Us Excelsia University College was founded in 1983 as Australia’s first Christian arts college and, together with Indiana Wesleyan University, we are part of a global Christian learning community with big plans to take Christian higher education to the next level in Australia and the Asia-Pacific region for undergraduate and postgraduate students. Excelsia Benefits Maximise your “take home” income through our Salary Packaging scheme. Enjoy family friendly policies, providing generous leave and working conditions. Experience working in a spiritually rich environment, with opportunities to engage in devotions. Upskill with our substantial tuition discount to eligible staff and their immediate families to study Excelsia courses. Our employees have access to earned wages, the ability to save before you’re paid, financial education, and much more. This full-time position is based in Pennant Hills. How to Apply If you meet the above criteria, you have a great opportunity to join our Christian community. Please provide your application with resume and covering letter addressing the position criteria via this website. If you have any queries regarding the position or application process, please contact us via work@excelsia.edu.au. This position may be filled as soon as a suitable applicant is found, so early applications are encouraged. Excelsia University College is a smoke free campus. Company Overview Excelsia contributes to making a better world through active participation in a life-transforming global Christian learning community. Apply now Share this job Refer a friend Copy link Twitter LinkedIn Facebook Report this job × Your reason Fraudulent or scam job posting Inappropriate or offensive content Misleading job description Duplicate job posting Other 0 / 100 Additional comments (optional) 0 / 500 Your email (optional, for follow-up) Please enter a valid email address. Something went wrong. Please try again. Cancel Report COMPANY About us Careers News & Media Partners Hero Foundation GET IN TOUCH Contact us Request a demo SUPPORT Help Centre System status Release notes PRODUCT Employment OS HR & Compliance Recruitment Agent Payroll & Rostering HeroForce Benefits & Perks Integrations Case Studies Pricing LEARN Blog Events Webinars Factsheets Case Studies Templates Whitepapers Reports Press Releases PICK YOUR REGION Australia New Zealand United Kingdom Canada Singapore Malaysia CONNECT in f 𝕏 ig ▶ STAY IN THE LOOP The latest employment law updates, product news and HR tips — straight to you