      "description": "Academic Administration Assistant Job at Excelsia University College You have been redirected to your preferred market of Australia . Clear preference × You're viewing our Australia site. Select your region to visit the most relevant site for you. Select region New Zealand United Kingdom Singapore Malaysia Canada (Français) Canada (English) × Work Jobs Find the role Land the role Ask Hero AI Learn Login Work HR & Recruitment Payroll Employee Jobs Jobseeker AU Australia New Zealand United Kingdom Canada Singapore Malaysia Get started Jobseeker Employee Employer Work Jobs Find the role Land the role Ask Hero AI Learn Login Australia Back Learn Trending Blogs Psychological safety at work: what it is, why it matters, and how to tell if you have it 5 min read Blogs Workplace stress risk assessment: are you actually okay going into the new year? 5 min read Blogs Career planning in your 20s, 30s, and 40s — what actually matters at each stage 5 min read Blogs The quiet signs you’re burning out at work (and what to do before it gets worse) 4 min read Resource Types Webinars & Events Salary Calculator Blogs & Guides Interview Prep Support Centre Career Advice All Resources Topics AI Best Practice Workplace Effectiveness Wellbeing at Work Learning & Development Remote Working Employment Index Interview Preparation Benchmark Your Salary Job Hunting Tips Making Your Salary Go Further Writing a Great CV Networking Career Planning Future of Work Mentorship All Topics Get Started Trending Blogs Psychological safety at work: what it is, why it matters, and how to tell if you have it 5 min read Blogs Workplace stress risk assessment: are you actually okay going into the new year? 5 min read Blogs Career planning in your 20s, 30s, and 40s — what actually matters at each stage 5 min read Resource Types Webinars & Events Salary Calculator Blogs & Guides Interview Prep Support Centre Career Advice All Resources Topics AI Best Practice Workplace Effectiveness Wellbei